{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013utGsN94tiegokU3uv2PS3","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tid: srd011-magefiles\n2\ttitle: \"magefiles: Build Lifecycle Targets (scaffold-provided)\"\n3\t\n4\tproblem: |\n5\t  go-unix-utils needs build, lint, clean, and install mage targets for its development\n6\t  workflow. These targets are provided by the cobbler-scaffold orchestrator library and\n7\t  exposed via magefiles/orchestrator.go, which is generated by mage scaffold:push. This\n8\t  SRD documents the build lifecycle contract for traceability but requires no code\n9\t  generation — all requirements are satisfied by the scaffold.\n10\t\n11\tgoals:\n12\t  - G1: Document the build lifecycle targets provided by cobbler-scaffold.\n13\t  - G2: Document the configuration contract between magefiles/ and configuration.yaml.\n14\t\n15\trequirements:\n16\t  R1:\n17\t    title: Build target (scaffold-provided)\n18\t    items:\n19\t      - R1.1:\n20\t          text: |\n21\t            mage build compiles every package under cmd/ to a binary in the directory\n22\t            specified by configuration.yaml project.binary_dir (default: bin/). Provided\n23\t            by cobbler-scaffold orchestrator.\n24\t\n25\t  R2:\n26\t    title: Lint target (scaffold-provided)\n27\t    items:\n28\t      - R2.1:\n29\t          text: |\n30\t            mage lint runs golangci-lint on all Go source directories listed in\n31\t            configuration.yaml project.go_source_dirs. Provided by cobbler-scaffold\n32\t            orchestrator.\n33\t\n34\t  R3:\n35\t    title: Clean target (scaffold-provided)\n36\t    items:\n37\t      - R3.1:\n38\t          text: |\n39\t            mage clean removes the binary_dir and all its contents. If the directory\n40\t            does not exist, the target succeeds silently. Provided by cobbler-scaffold\n41\t            orchestrator.\n42\t\n43\t  R4:\n44\t    title: Install target (scaffold-provided)\n45\t    items:\n46\t      - R4.1:\n47\t          text: |\n48\t            mage install runs go install for every package under cmd/. Provided by\n49\t            cobbler-scaffold orchestrator.\n50\t\n51\t  R5:\n52\t    title: Configuration contract (scaffold-provided)\n53\t    items:\n54\t      - R5.1:\n55\t          text: |\n56\t            configuration.yaml project section must contain module_path, binary_dir,\n57\t            go_source_dirs, and magefiles_dir fields. Populated by mage scaffold:push.\n58\t\n59\tnon_goals:\n60\t  - This SRD does not specify orchestrator, generator, scaffold, prompt, or stats targets. Those are provided by cobbler-scaffold.\n61\t  - cmd/version is specified separately in srd059-version.\n62\t\n63\tacceptance_criteria:\n64\t  - id: AC1\n65\t    criterion: \"mage build compiles cmd/ binaries to bin/. Provided by cobbler-scaffold.\"\n66\t    traces: [R1.1]\n67\t  - id: AC2\n68\t    criterion: \"mage lint runs with no warnings. Provided by cobbler-scaffold.\"\n69\t    traces: [R2.1]\n70\t  - id: AC3\n71\t    criterion: \"mage clean removes bin/. Provided by cobbler-scaffold.\"\n72\t    traces: [R3.1]\n73\t  - id: AC4\n74\t    criterion: \"mage install runs go install for every package under cmd/. Provided by cobbler-scaffold.\"\n75\t    traces: [R4.1]\n76\t  - id: AC5\n77\t    criterion: \"configuration.yaml project fields are present. Populated by scaffold:push.\"\n78\t    traces: [R5.1]\n79\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f3973621-b5f4-4c44-adc3-0118bf6028ed","uuid":"1425553d-3997-4d79-94b1-877484e2115e","timestamp":"2026-05-14T00:46:34.421Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5109/docs/specs/software-requirements/srd011-magefiles.yaml","content":"id: srd011-magefiles\ntitle: \"magefiles: Build Lifecycle Targets (scaffold-provided)\"\n\nproblem: |\n  go-unix-utils needs build, lint, clean, and install mage targets for its development\n  workflow. These targets are provided by the cobbler-scaffold orchestrator library and\n  exposed via magefiles/orchestrator.go, which is generated by mage scaffold:push. This\n  SRD documents the build lifecycle contract for traceability but requires no code\n  generation — all requirements are satisfied by the scaffold.\n\ngoals:\n  - G1: Document the build lifecycle targets provided by cobbler-scaffold.\n  - G2: Document the configuration contract between magefiles/ and configuration.yaml.\n\nrequirements:\n  R1:\n    title: Build target (scaffold-provided)\n    items:\n      - R1.1:\n          text: |\n            mage build compiles every package under cmd/ to a binary in the directory\n            specified by configuration.yaml project.binary_dir (default: bin/). Provided\n            by cobbler-scaffold orchestrator.\n\n  R2:\n    title: Lint target (scaffold-provided)\n    items:\n      - R2.1:\n          text: |\n            mage lint runs golangci-lint on all Go source directories listed in\n            configuration.yaml project.go_source_dirs. Provided by cobbler-scaffold\n            orchestrator.\n\n  R3:\n    title: Clean target (scaffold-provided)\n    items:\n      - R3.1:\n          text: |\n            mage clean removes the binary_dir and all its contents. If the directory\n            does not exist, the target succeeds silently. Provided by cobbler-scaffold\n            orchestrator.\n\n  R4:\n    title: Install target (scaffold-provided)\n    items:\n      - R4.1:\n          text: |\n            mage install runs go install for every package under cmd/. Provided by\n            cobbler-scaffold orchestrator.\n\n  R5:\n    title: Configuration contract (scaffold-provided)\n    items:\n      - R5.1:\n          text: |\n            configuration.yaml project section must contain module_path, binary_dir,\n            go_source_dirs, and magefiles_dir fields. Populated by mage scaffold:push.\n\nnon_goals:\n  - This SRD does not specify orchestrator, generator, scaffold, prompt, or stats targets. Those are provided by cobbler-scaffold.\n  - cmd/version is specified separately in srd059-version.\n\nacceptance_criteria:\n  - id: AC1\n    criterion: \"mage build compiles cmd/ binaries to bin/. Provided by cobbler-scaffold.\"\n    traces: [R1.1]\n  - id: AC2\n    criterion: \"mage lint runs with no warnings. Provided by cobbler-scaffold.\"\n    traces: [R2.1]\n  - id: AC3\n    criterion: \"mage clean removes bin/. Provided by cobbler-scaffold.\"\n    traces: [R3.1]\n  - id: AC4\n    criterion: \"mage install runs go install for every package under cmd/. Provided by cobbler-scaffold.\"\n    traces: [R4.1]\n  - id: AC5\n    criterion: \"configuration.yaml project fields are present. Populated by scaffold:push.\"\n    traces: [R5.1]\n","numLines":79,"startLine":1,"totalLines":79}}}
